{
  "source": "..\\api\\mime.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "MIME",
      "name": "mime",
      "desc": "<p><code>mime</code> 模块用于解析 MIME 类型字符串, 根据文件扩展名查询 MIME 类型, 以及访问预定义 MIME 常量.</p>\n<p>MIME 类型的基本格式为 <code>type/subtype</code>, 并可在分号后附加参数. 更多概念参阅 <a href=\"mimeTypeGlossary\">MIME 类型</a>.</p>\n<p><code>mime</code> 与 <code>$mime</code> 引用同一个对象.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let parsed = mime(&#39;text/plain; charset=utf-8&#39;);\n\nparsed.type; // &quot;text&quot;\nparsed.subtype; // &quot;plain&quot;\nparsed.mimeTypeRefined; // &quot;text/plain&quot;\nparsed.parameters.charset; // &quot;utf-8&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">mime</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] mime",
          "name": "[@]_mime",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime(mimeString)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "mime",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>mimeString</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#jsmime\">JsMime</a> } - MIME 解析结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解析 MIME 类型字符串.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let parsed = mime(&#39;application/json; charset=utf-8&#39;);\n\nconsole.log(parsed.type); // application\nconsole.log(parsed.subtype); // json\nconsole.log(parsed.mimeType); // application/json; charset=utf-8\nconsole.log(parsed.mimeTypeRefined); // application/json\nconsole.log(parsed.parameters); // { charset: &quot;utf-8&quot; }\nconsole.log(parsed.raw); // application/json; charset=utf-8\n</code></pre>\n<p>参数数量必须为 1. MIME 类型字符串无效时抛出异常.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "mimeString"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] mime"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] getMediaType",
          "name": "[m]_getmediatype",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime.getMediaType(mediaType)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "getMediaType",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>mediaType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { okhttp3.MediaType } - OkHttp 媒体类型对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将字符串解析为 <code>okhttp3.MediaType</code>.</p>\n<p>字符串不符合 OkHttp 媒体类型语法时抛出异常.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let mediaType = mime.getMediaType(&#39;application/json; charset=utf-8&#39;);\n\nconsole.log(mediaType.toString()); // application/json; charset=utf-8\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "mediaType"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] getMediaType"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] parseMediaType",
          "name": "[m]_parsemediatype",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime.parseMediaType(mediaType)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "parseMediaType",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>mediaType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { okhttp3.MediaType | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - OkHttp 媒体类型对象, 解析失败时为 <code>null</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>尝试将字符串解析为 <code>okhttp3.MediaType</code>.</p>\n<p>与 <a href=\"#m-getmediatype\">mime.getMediaType</a> 不同, 字符串无效时返回 <code>null</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">mime.parseMediaType(&#39;text/plain&#39;) !== null; // true\nmime.parseMediaType(&#39;not a mime type&#39;) === null; // true\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "mediaType"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] parseMediaType"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] fromFile",
          "name": "[m]_fromfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime.fromFile(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "fromFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 文件路径或文件名</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - MIME 类型, 未识别扩展名时为 <code>null</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>根据文件扩展名查询 MIME 类型.</p>\n<p>此方法只解析路径中的扩展名, 不读取文件内容. 路径没有扩展名时返回 <a href=\"#p-wildcard\">mime.WILDCARD</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">mime.fromFile(&#39;/sdcard/report.pdf&#39;); // &quot;application/pdf&quot;\nmime.fromFile(&#39;/sdcard/picture.png&#39;); // &quot;image/png&quot;\nmime.fromFile(&#39;/sdcard/README&#39;); // &quot;*/*&quot;\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] fromFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] fromFileOr",
          "name": "[m]_fromfileor",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime.fromFileOr(path, defaultType)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "fromFileOr",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 文件路径或文件名</li>\n<li><strong>defaultType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 未识别扩展名时使用的 MIME 类型</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型</li>\n</ul>\n<p>根据文件扩展名查询 MIME 类型. 扩展名无法识别时返回 <code>defaultType</code>.</p>\n<p>当 <code>defaultType</code> 为 <code>null</code> 时, 使用 <a href=\"#p-wildcard\">mime.WILDCARD</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">mime.fromFileOr(&#39;/sdcard/data.unknown_ext&#39;, &#39;application/octet-stream&#39;);\n// &quot;application/octet-stream&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<p>路径没有扩展名时, <a href=\"#m-fromfile\">mime.fromFile</a> 会直接返回 <code>*/*</code>, 因此不会使用 <code>defaultType</code>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "defaultType"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] fromFileOr"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] fromFileOrWildcard",
          "name": "[m]_fromfileorwildcard",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime.fromFileOrWildcard(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "fromFileOrWildcard",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 文件路径或文件名</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型</li>\n</ul>\n<p>根据文件扩展名查询 MIME 类型. 扩展名无法识别时返回 <code>*/*</code>.</p>\n<p>等价于 <code>mime.fromFileOr(path, mime.WILDCARD)</code>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] fromFileOrWildcard"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "MIME 常量",
          "name": "mime_常量",
          "desc": "<p><code>mime</code> 包含 2500 余个 MIME 字符串常量. 常量名称通常由 MIME 类型转换为大写下划线形式, 如 <code>application/json</code> 对应 <code>APPLICATION_JSON</code>.</p>\n<p>以下列出常用常量. 更多 MIME 类型参阅 <a href=\"mimeTypeGlossary\">MIME 类型</a>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "MIME 常量"
        },
