              "name": "WILDCARD",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong> <strong><code>CONSTANT</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[[ <code>&#39;*/*&#39;</code> ]] { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任意 MIME 类型.</p>\n"
